{
  "_about": "The parks makeover (docs/runbooks/parks.md): the natural park on a 220 x 200 site with its places (moods) and designed ground; frame times before the build, with the ground and with it switched off; close looks at the gully floor, scree, meadow flowers, the wet hollow, runoff, leaf litter, path grit and the rocks from low. Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/ground-parks.json -Who makeover-parks",
